<title>USA: Guess? names Robert Davis to board.</title>
<headline>Guess? names Robert Davis to board.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guess? Inc on Friday said it named Robert Davis to its board of directors, increasing the number of directors to five.</p>
<p>Davis, 50, is the former president and chief operating officer of St. John Knits, a maker of women's clothing and accessories. He is currently a consultant to Guess?.</p>
<p>Before joining St. John Knits in 1980, Davis was a partner at a Chicago-area law firm where he handled corporate, labor and litigation matters from 1973 to 1980.</p>
